flowchart LR
    subgraph Budget limit
        B1[Remaining after pending of discretionary targets] --> B3[Budget limit]
        B2[Unposted discretionary commitments to horizon end or period end] --> B3
    end
    subgraph Cash limit
        C1[Cash forecast over the horizon] --> C2[Lowest closing balance]
        C2 --> C4[Cash limit]
        C3[Minimum buffer] --> C4
    end
    B3 --> D{Smaller limit}
    C4 --> D
    D -->|positive| E[Estimate]
    D -->|negative| F[Estimate zero and shortfall shown]
